@prefix : <http://example.org/paper#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
# Cyclic graph (A->B, B->C, A->C shortcut, C->A back edge): naive walk enumeration for
# :p+ / :p* is INFINITE (cycle A->C->A and A->B->C->A), but the level-indexed circuit is finite.
:e1 rdf:subject :A ; rdf:predicate :p ; rdf:object :B .
:e2 rdf:subject :B ; rdf:predicate :p ; rdf:object :C .
:e3 rdf:subject :A ; rdf:predicate :p ; rdf:object :C .
:e4 rdf:subject :C ; rdf:predicate :p ; rdf:object :A .
